infographic compare-binary-horizontal-underline-text-vs
data
  title PATCH validation: surgical vs blunt
  desc Both make absent fields valid — one scopes optionality to a single DTO, the other to the whole app
  compares
    - label PartialType(CreateUserDto)
      children
        - label Scoped to one update DTO
          desc Optionality applies only to UpdateUserDto
        - label Original decorators preserved
          desc Present fields still validate by their own rules
        - label Required fields intact elsewhere
          desc Every other DTO keeps demanding its required fields
    - label skipMissingProperties true
      children
        - label Global across every DTO
          desc Relaxes missing-property checks app-wide
        - label Required fields silently optional
          desc A required-but-forgotten field now passes
        - label One blunt pipe flag
          desc Cannot scope optionality to a single route
theme
  palette #14b8a6 #f43f5e
